    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The UK-based Wellcome Trust Foundation recently awarded US $500,000 research grant to Aga Khan University (AKU) for a study on high blood pressure. The study was designed by Dr. Tazeen Jafar, Assistant Professor, and her colleagues at the Department of Medicine, and the Community Health Sciences, AKU.",
